{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a695e290b6e713b2","name":"Burrower Drive","source":{"id":"source:reference-a695e290b6e713b2","title":"Burrower Drive","revision":16413,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:50Z","sha256":"153b456b94fdfb3e3212e7dff88b5212fa3f878a58f380c15e4be1431c9f38d4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16413","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Burrower%20Drive&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a695e290b6e713b2","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 200 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"}," x (Speed squared)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," (50 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},") Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Mining and other ",{"tag":"a","children":["5th-Degree Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/5th-Degree_Droids","referenceId":"reference:d4243a54b2193101"}," can use a Burrower Drive to tear through large chunks of ore embedded in the crust of a planet or in an asteroid. A Burrower Drive enables a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," to move at half-speed underground. It can also move vertically up or down at a similar rate.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Burrower Drive can be used as a weapon. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," makes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"},". If the attack is successful, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," deals damage equal to the amount it would do if it had used a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Self-Destruct System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Self-Destruct_System","referenceId":"reference:69d3c9eb720267d8"},". However, each successful attack moves the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," -1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"},", as the drill gears and bits strip down and damage the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
